<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Activated - BoloIndia</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #2196F3;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #2196F3;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background-color: #2196F3;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #0b7dda;
        }
        .success-box {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196F3;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✅ Account Activated!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,</p>
            
            <p>Great news! Your BoloIndia account has been successfully activated. You can now log in and start using the platform.</p>
            
            <div class="success-box">
                <p><strong>✓</strong> Your account is now active</p>
                <p><strong>✓</strong> You have access to all assigned features</p>
                <p><strong>✓</strong> You can log in anytime</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="http://localhost:5173/login" class="button">Log In Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <p>Your login credentials:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>📧 Email: <strong>{{email}}</strong></li>
                <li>🔑 Password: <em>The password you just set</em></li>
            </ul>
            
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2025 BoloIndia. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
